msgstr "すべての公開ルートでtwitter:siteとして出力されるサイトのハンドルです。出力しない場合は空白のままにしてください。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1247
msgid ""
"og:image URL when a route has no image of its own. Falls back to the "
"WordPress site logo / icon when this is empty."
msgstr "独自の画像がないページで使用するog:imageのURLです。空の場合は、WordPressのサイトロゴ／アイコンが使用されます。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1251
msgid "Verify SEO"
msgstr "SEOを確認"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1254
msgid "Open XML sitemap"
msgstr "XMLサイトマップを開く"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1257
#. translators: 1: plural space label, 2: plural topic label, 3: plural space label.
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Confirms /wp-sitemap.xml is reachable and that community URLs (%1$s + %2$s) "
"are listed. New %3$s can take a few minutes to appear after the next ping."
msgstr ""
"/wp-sitemap.xml にアクセスでき、コミュニティのURL（%1$s と "
"%2$s）が掲載されていることを確認します。新しい%3$sは、次回のpingの後、表示されるまで数分かかる場合があります。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1266
msgid "Social Embeds (Instagram & Facebook)"
msgstr "ソーシャル埋め込み（Instagram & Facebook）"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1268
msgid ""
"YouTube, Vimeo, TikTok, Twitter/X, Spotify, SoundCloud, and TED Talks embed "
"automatically with no setup required. Instagram and Facebook require a free "
"Meta Developer App because Meta deprecated anonymous oEmbed access in "
"October 2020."
msgstr ""
"YouTube、Vimeo、TikTok、Twitter/X、Spotify、SoundCloud、TED "
"Talksは設定不要で自動的に埋め込まれます。InstagramとFacebookは、Metaが2020年10"
"月に匿名のoEmbedアクセスを廃止したため、無料のMeta Developer Appが必要です。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1273
msgid "Facebook App ID"
msgstr "FacebookアプリID"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1276
msgid "Numeric App ID from your Meta Developer dashboard."
msgstr "Meta Developerダッシュボードに表示される数値のアプリIDです。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1280
msgid "Facebook App Secret"
msgstr "Facebookアプリシークレット"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1283
msgid "Secret is stored in wp_options and never exposed to the frontend."
msgstr "シークレットはwp_optionsに保存され、フロントエンドに公開されることはありません。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1290
msgid "How to create a Facebook App (5 minutes, free)"
msgstr "Facebookアプリの作成方法（5分、無料）"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1297
#. translators: 1: developers.facebook.com URL, 2: Create App button label
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Go to %1$s and log in with a Facebook account. Click %2$s in the top-right "
"corner."
msgstr "%1$sにアクセスし、Facebookアカウントでログインしてください。右上の%2$sをクリックします。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1299
msgid "Create App"
msgstr "アプリを作成"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1307
#. translators: 1: "Other" use-case label, 2: "Business" app type label
#, php-format
msgid ""
"When asked \"What do you want your app to do?\", pick %1$s. When asked for "
"the app type, pick %2$s. Name it anything, e.g. \"My Forum Embeds\"."
msgstr ""
"「アプリで何をしたいですか？」と聞かれたら%1$sを選択してください。アプリの種類を聞かれたら%2$sを選択します。名前は「My Forum "
"Embeds」など任意のものをつけてください。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1309
msgid "Business"
msgstr "ビジネス"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1317
#. translators: %s: "oEmbed Read" product label
#, php-format
msgid ""
"On the new app's dashboard, find the %s product in the Products list and "
"click Set Up. It's free."
msgstr "新しいアプリのダッシュボードで、製品一覧から%sを見つけて「設定」をクリックしてください。無料です。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1318
msgid "oEmbed Read"
msgstr "oEmbed Read"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1326
#. translators: 1: "Settings > Basic" breadcrumb, 2: App ID label, 3: App Secret label
#, php-format
msgid "Open %1$s. Copy the %2$s and %3$s and paste them into the two fields above."
msgstr "%1$sを開き、%2$sと%3$sをコピーして、上の2つのフィールドに貼り付けてください。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1327
msgid "Settings → Basic"
msgstr "設定 → ベーシック"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1328
msgid "App ID"
msgstr "アプリID"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1329
msgid "App Secret"
msgstr "アプリシークレット"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1337
#. translators: 1: "App Review > Requests" breadcrumb, 2: "oembed_read" permission name
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Go to %1$s and request the %2$s permission. Meta typically approves in 1-3 "
"business days. Your app stays in Development Mode until approved; embeds "
"will work for the admin who created the app even before approval."
msgstr ""
"%1$sにアクセスし、%2$s権限をリクエストしてください。Metaによる承認は通常1～3"
"営業日で完了します。承認されるまでアプリは開発モードのままですが、承認前でも、アプリを作成した管理者には埋め込みが表示されます。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1338
msgid "App Review → Requests"
msgstr "アプリレビュー → リクエスト"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1344
#. translators: 1: topic label, plural, lowercase (e.g. "topics"). 2: reply label, plural, lowercase (e.g. "replies").
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Save the settings here. Instagram and Facebook URLs pasted into %1$s and "
"%2$s will now unfurl as rich embeds."
msgstr ""
"ここで設定を保存してください。%1$sや%2$"
"sに貼り付けられたInstagramおよびFacebookのURLが、リッチ埋め込みとして展開されるようになります。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1348
msgid "Privacy note:"
msgstr "プライバシーに関するご注意："

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1349
msgid ""
"Jetonomy only sends oEmbed requests to Meta when a user pastes an "
"Instagram/Facebook URL. No tracking, no user data: just the public post URL "
"and your app token. Leave these fields blank to skip Instagram/Facebook "
"embeds entirely; the URL will render as a plain clickable link."
msgstr ""
"Jetonomyは、ユーザーがInstagram/Facebook "
"URLを貼り付けた場合にのみMetaへoEmbedリクエストを送信します。トラッキングやユーザーデータの送信はなく、送信するのは公開投稿のURLとアプリ"
"トークンのみです。これらのフィールドを空欄のままにすると、Instagram/"
"Facebookの埋め込みをすべてスキップし、URLはクリック可能なプレーンリンクとして表示されます。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1357
#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1560
msgid "SEO Pro"
msgstr "SEO Pro"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1359
#. translators: %s: the singular space label the site owner configured (e.g. space, group).
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Open Graph tags, per-%s canonical URLs, breadcrumb schema, and advanced "
"robots control."
msgstr "Open Graphタグ、%sごとのcanonical URL、パンくずリストのスキーマ、高度なrobots制御を提供します。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1372
#. translators: 1: topic label, plural, lowercase (e.g. "topics"). 2: reply label, plural, lowercase (e.g. "replies"). 3: link to the Akismet settings screen.
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Akismet is active but has no API key, so new %1$s and %2$s are not checked "
"for spam. %3$s"
msgstr "Akismetは有効ですがAPIキーが設定されていないため、新しい%1$sや%2$sのスパムチェックは行われません。%3$s"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1375
msgid "Add an Akismet API key"
msgstr "AkismetのAPIキーを追加"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1385
