msgstr "CAPTCHAプロバイダー"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1386
#. translators: 1: topic label, lowercase (e.g. "topic"). 2: reply label, lowercase (e.g. "reply"). 3: member label, plural, lowercase (e.g. "members").
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Protect %1$s and %2$s forms from bots. Trusted %3$s (trust level 2+) are "
"always exempt."
msgstr "%1$sや%2$sのフォームをボットから保護します。信頼できる%3$s（信頼レベル2以上）は常に対象外です。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1395
msgid ""
"A CAPTCHA provider is selected but the Site Key and/or Secret Key is empty. "
"The CAPTCHA will not render until both keys are filled in."
msgstr "CAPTCHAプロバイダーが選択されていますが、サイトキーまたはシークレットキーが空です。両方のキーが入力されるまでCAPTCHAは表示されません。"

