#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1451
msgid ""
"reCAPTCHA v3 only. Scores below this value are treated as bots (0.1 = "
"permissive, 0.9 = strict). Default: 0.5."
msgstr "reCAPTCHA v3のみ。この値を下回るスコアはボットとして扱われます（0.1 = 寛容、0.9 = 厳格）。デフォルト：0.5。"

