#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1464
msgid ""
"Your community is growing. Give it reactions, messaging, polls, analytics, "
"badges, webhooks, and more. Each feature is an independent module you "
"enable only when you need it."
msgstr ""
"コミュニティが成長しています。リアクション、メッセージ、投票、分析、バッジ、Webhookなど、さまざまな機能を追加できます。各機能は必要なときだけ有効"
"にできる独立したモジュールです。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1467
msgid "Get Jetonomy Pro. Starting at $69/yr."
msgstr "Jetonomy Proを入手する。年額$69から。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1472
#. translators: %s: coupon code
#, php-format
msgid "Use code %s for 30%% off lifetime plans."
msgstr "コード%sをご利用いただくと、ライフタイムプランが30%%オフになります。"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1481
msgid "Pro Extensions"
msgstr "Pro拡張機能"

#: includes/admin/views/settings.php:1482
msgid ""
